# Intentionally empty.
#
# An earlier version of this file 301-redirected the extensionless
# alias of each page (e.g. /contact) to its .html file. That's no
# longer how this site handles it — every page's <link rel="canonical">
# (and og:url / JSON-LD url) now declares the extensionless URL as the
# real one directly, so a redirect back to .html here would undo that
# and send visitors/crawlers the wrong way. Kept as an empty file rather
# than deleted just so the next person to look doesn't wonder if it's
# missing by accident.
